{
  "_comment": [
    "chromium-headless-shell 在 HBOS 镜像里的完备性期望清单。",
    "读取者:scripts/check_headless_deps.py(校验)、scripts/fix_headless_layout.py(幂等修复)。",
    "这份清单就是'手工踩坑'的固化:改动它、或者把 --expect 指向一份被篡改的副本,",
    "工具必须报 FAIL —— 这就是它的检出能力的自测方式。"
  ],
  "image": "build/c3-chromium.img",
  "offset": 1048576,

  "shell": "/opt/chromium-headless-shell/usr/lib/chromium/chromium-headless-shell",
  "resource_dir": "/opt/chromium-headless-shell/usr/lib/chromium",
  "resource_source_dir": "/opt/chromium-common/usr/lib/chromium",

  "_hbos_provided_comment": [
    "由 HBOS 自己提供(仓库根的 *.hax + 内核/用户态 libc),镜像里不需要出现,也不算缺失。",
    "查找顺序是'先镜像后自带':镜像里确实有的话以镜像为准,避免包被删掉时被误判成自带。"
  ],
  "hbos_provided_sonames": [
    "ld-linux-x86-64.so.2",
    "libc.so.6",
    "libm.so.6",
    "libpthread.so.0",
    "librt.so.1",
    "libdl.so.2",
    "libutil.so.1",
    "libresolv.so.2"
  ],

