  "_optional_resources_comment": [
    "不是 DT_NEEDED,而是 Chromium 自己按 dirname(/proc/self/exe) 去 dlopen/exec 的东西",
    "(GPU 进程的 ANGLE/SwiftShader、crashpad handler)。headless --dump-dom 不一定用得上,",
    "所以只报 WARN 不报 FAIL;要补齐用 scripts/fix_headless_layout.sh --include-optional。"
  ],
  "optional_resources": [
    "libEGL.so",
    "libGLESv2.so",
    "libvk_swiftshader.so",
    "libvulkan.so.1",
    "vk_swiftshader_icd.json",
    "chrome_crashpad_handler"
  ],
  "helper_search_dirs": [
    "/opt/chromium-common/usr/lib/chromium",
    "/opt/chromium/usr/lib/chromium"
  ],

  "_required_symbols_comment": [
    "版本敏感符号:这些符号在旧版库里不存在,只查'库在不在'是查不出来的。",
    "libharfbuzz.so.0 这两项由实测得出:镜像里的 6.0.0(libharfbuzz.so.0.60000.0)",
    "恰好缺 hb_face_set_get_table_tags_func,命中过 exit 127。"
  ],
  "required_symbols": {
    "libharfbuzz.so.0": [
      "hb_face_set_get_table_tags_func"
    ]
  },

  "_symbol_families_comment": [
    "符号族:从 shell 的未定义动态符号里按前缀取出'这个库该提供什么',",
    "再要求该族的库真的导出它们 —— 直接对应 'undefined symbol → exit 127' 那类坑。",
    "libs 是联合检查(glib/gobject/gio 这种拆包;libX11 系;nss 系)。"
  ],
